DEFINE MATERIAL START
ISOTROPIC CONCRETE
E 25000000
POISSON 0.17
DENSITY 25
ALPHA 1e-05
DAMP 0.05
TYPE CONCRETE
STRENGTH FCU 25000
END DEFINE MATERIAL
MEMBER PROPERTY INDIAN
1 TO 120 PRIS YD 0.4 ZD 0.4
121 TO 306 PRIS YD 0.45 ZD 0.3
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL CONCRETE ALL
SUPPORTS
1 TO 20 FIXED
DEFINE 1893 LOAD
ZONE 0.1 RF 5 I 1 SS 2 ST 1 DM 0.05
SELFWEIGHT
MEMBER WEIGHT 121 TO 124 133 TO 140 149 TO 156 165 TO 172 181 TO 188 -
  197 TO 204 213 TO 219 229 TO 234 244 TO 249 259 TO 264 274 TO 279 -
  289 TO 294 304 TO 306 UNI 12.65
FLOOR WEIGHT
YRANGE 3.1 19.3 FLOAD 5.75 GY
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE Dead TITLE DEAD LOAD
SELFWEIGHT Y -1
MEMBER LOAD 121 TO 124 133 TO 140 149 TO 156 165 TO 172 181 TO 188 197 -
  TO 204 213 TO 219 229 TO 234 244 TO 249 259 TO 264 274 TO 279 289 TO -
  294 304 TO 306 UNI GY -12.65
FLOOR LOAD
YRANGE 3.1 19.3 FLOAD -5.25 GY
LOAD 2 LOADTYPE Live TITLE LIVE LOAD
FLOOR LOAD
YRANGE 3.1 19.099999999999998 FLOAD -2.0 GY
YRANGE 19.099999999999998 19.3 FLOAD -1.5 GY
LOAD 3 LOADTYPE Seismic TITLE EQ +X
1893 LOAD X 1
LOAD 4 LOADTYPE Seismic TITLE EQ +Z
1893 LOAD Z 1
LOAD COMB 11 1.5 (DL + LL)
1 1.5 2 1.5
LOAD COMB 12 1.2 (DL + LL + EQX)
1 1.2 2 1.2 3 1.2
LOAD COMB 13 1.2 (DL + LL - EQX)
1 1.2 2 1.2 3 -1.2
LOAD COMB 14 1.2 (DL + LL + EQZ)
1 1.2 2 1.2 4 1.2
LOAD COMB 15 1.2 (DL + LL - EQZ)
1 1.2 2 1.2 4 -1.2
LOAD COMB 16 1.5 (DL + EQX)
1 1.5 3 1.5
LOAD COMB 17 1.5 (DL - EQX)
1 1.5 3 -1.5
LOAD COMB 18 1.5 (DL + EQZ)
1 1.5 4 1.5
LOAD COMB 19 1.5 (DL - EQZ)
1 1.5 4 -1.5
LOAD COMB 20 0.9DL + 1.5EQX
1 0.9 3 1.5
LOAD COMB 21 0.9DL - 1.5EQX
1 0.9 3 -1.5
LOAD COMB 22 0.9DL + 1.5EQZ
1 0.9 4 1.5
LOAD COMB 23 0.9DL - 1.5EQZ
1 0.9 4 -1.5
PERFORM ANALYSIS PRINT STATICS CHECK
START CONCRETE DESIGN
CODE INDIAN
FYMAIN 500 ALL
FYSEC 500 ALL
FC 25000 ALL
TRACK 2 ALL
DESIGN BEAM 121 TO 306
DESIGN COLUMN 1 TO 120
CONCRETE TAKE OFF
END CONCRETE DESIGN
FINISH
